{{burden}}{{/ˈbɜːdn}}{{n./v. 负担；使负重}}{{The financial burden was too heavy for the family.}}
{{bureau}}{{/ˈbjʊərəʊ}}{{n. 局；处；办公室}}{{The Federal Bureau of Investigation handles federal crimes.}}
{{burst}}{{/bɜːst}}{{v./n. 爆裂；突然发生}}{{The balloon burst when he sat on it.}}
{{bypass}}{{/ˈbaɪpɑːs}}{{v./n. 绕过；旁路}}{{We took the bypass to avoid the traffic jam.}}
{{calculate}}{{/ˈkælkjuleɪt}}{{v. 计算；估计}}{{Scientists calculated the distance between the two stars.}}
{{campaign}}{{/kæmˈpeɪn}}{{n./v. 运动；战役}}{{The marketing campaign was a huge success.}}
{{candidate}}{{/ˈkændɪdət}}{{n. 候选人；应试者}}{{There are five candidates for the position.}}
{{capacity}}{{/kəˈpæsəti}}{{n. 能力；容量；身份}}{{The stadium has a capacity of 50,000 spectators.}}
{{capsule}}{{/ˈkæpsjuːl}}{{n. 胶囊；太空舱；小容器}}{{The medicine comes in capsule form.}}
{{capture}}{{/ˈkæptʃər}}{{v./n. 捕获；夺取}}{{The photographer captured a beautiful sunset.}}
{{casual}}{{/ˈkæʒuəl}}{{adj. 随便的；偶然的}}{{He wore casual clothes to the party.}}
{{catalogue}}{{/ˈkætəlɒɡ}}{{n. 目录；一览表}}{{You can browse the product catalogue online.}}
{{catastrophe}}{{/kəˈtæstrəfi}}{{n. 灾难；大祸}}{{The oil spill was an environmental catastrophe.}}
{{category}}{{/ˈkætəɡəri}}{{n. 种类；类别}}{{The books are arranged by category in the library.}}
{{cease}}{{/siːs}}{{v. 停止；终止}}{{The factory ceased production due to lack of raw materials.}}
{{ceremony}}{{/ˈserəməni}}{{n. 典礼；仪式}}{{The opening ceremony of the Olympics was spectacular.}}
{{certificate}}{{/sərˈtɪfɪkət}}{{n. 证书；证明}}{{She received a certificate for completing the course.}}
{{challenge}}{{/ˈtʃælɪndʒ}}{{n./v. 挑战；质疑}}{{Learning a new language is always a challenge.}}
{{champion}}{{/ˈtʃæmpiən}}{{n. 冠军；拥护者}}{{She became the world champion in swimming.}}
{{channel}}{{/ˈtʃænl}}{{n. 频道；渠道；海峡}}{{The English Channel separates England from France.}}
{{chaos}}{{/ˈkeɪɒs}}{{n. 混乱；无秩序}}{{The earthquake left the city in chaos.}}
{{characteristic}}{{/ˌkærəktəˈrɪstɪk}}{{n./adj. 特征；特有的}}{{Kindness is one of her most admirable characteristics.}}
{{charter}}{{/ˈtʃɑːtər}}{{n./v. 宪章；包租；特许}}{{The company chartered a plane for the trip.}}
{{chronic}}{{/ˈkrɒnɪk}}{{adj. 慢性的；长期的}}{{He suffers from chronic back pain.}}
{{circulate}}{{/ˈsɜːkjəleɪt}}{{v. 循环；流通}}{{Blood circulates through the body continuously.}}
{{circumstance}}{{/ˈsɜːkəmstəns}}{{n. 环境；情况}}{{Under no circumstance should you give up.}}
{{cite}}{{/saɪt}}{{v. 引用；举例}}{{He cited several examples to support his argument.}}
{{claim}}{{/kleɪm}}{{v./n. 声称；索赔}}{{He claims to have seen a UFO.}}
{{clarify}}{{/ˈklærɪfaɪ}}{{v. 澄清；阐明}}{{Could you clarify what you mean by that statement?}}
{{clash}}{{/klæʃ}}{{v./n. 冲突；碰撞；争论}}{{The two groups clashed over the issue.}}
{{classify}}{{/ˈklæsɪfaɪ}}{{v. 分类；归类}}{{The books are classified by subject in the library.}}
{{clause}}{{/klɔːz}}{{n. 条款；从句；分句}}{{Please read the terms and clause carefully before signing.}}
{{climate}}{{/ˈklaɪmət}}{{n. 气候；风气}}{{Climate change is one of the biggest challenges of our time.}}
{{cling}}{{/klɪŋ}}{{v. 紧抓；附着；坚持}}{{The child clung to her mother's hand.}}
{{clinical}}{{/ˈklɪnɪkl}}{{adj. 临床的；冷静客观的}}{{The clinical trial showed promising results.}}
{{cluster}}{{/ˈklʌstər}}{{n./v. 群；簇；聚集}}{{A cluster of stars was visible in the night sky.}}
{{coalition}}{{/ˌkəʊəˈlɪʃn}}{{n. 联盟；联合}}{{The two parties formed a coalition government.}}
{{coincide}}{{/ˌkəʊɪnˈsaɪd}}{{v. 同时发生；一致；巧合}}{{The two events coincided by pure chance.}}
{{collaborate}}{{/kəˈlæbəreɪt}}{{v. 合作；协作}}{{The two companies collaborated on the research project.}}
{{collapse}}{{/kəˈlæps}}{{v./n. 倒塌；崩溃}}{{The building collapsed during the earthquake.}}
{{colleague}}{{/ˈkɒliːɡ}}{{n. 同事}}{{She gets along well with her colleagues at work.}}
{{colony}}{{/ˈkɒləni}}{{n. 殖民地；群落}}{{The country was once a British colony.}}
{{combat}}{{/ˈkɒmbæt}}{{n./v. 战斗；与…斗争}}{{The government is taking measures to combat corruption.}}
{{combine}}{{/kəmˈbaɪn}}{{v. 结合；联合}}{{The company combined two departments to improve efficiency.}}
{{command}}{{/kəˈmɑːnd}}{{v./n. 命令；掌握}}{{The general commanded his troops to advance.}}
{{commemorate}}{{/kəˈmeməreɪt}}{{v. 纪念；庆祝}}{{The monument commemorates the soldiers who died in the war.}}
{{commence}}{{/kəˈmens}}{{v. 开始；着手}}{{The ceremony will commence at 9 a.m.}}
{{commission}}{{/kəˈmɪʃn}}{{n./v. 委员会；佣金；委托}}{{The artist received a commission to paint a portrait.}}
{{commit}}{{/kəˈmɪt}}{{v. 犯(罪)；承诺；投入}}{{He committed himself to finishing the project on time.}}
{{committee}}{{/kəˈmɪti}}{{n. 委员会}}{{The committee meets every Monday to discuss policy.}}
{{commodity}}{{/kəˈmɒdəti}}{{n. 商品；日用品}}{{Oil is one of the most important commodities in the world.}}
{{communal}}{{/ˈkɒmjuːnl}}{{adj. 公共的；社区的；共有的}}{{The garden is a communal space for all residents.}}
{{communicate}}{{/kəˈmjuːnɪkeɪt}}{{v. 交流；传达}}{{It is important to communicate effectively with your team.}}
{{community}}{{/kəˈmjuːnəti}}{{n. 社区；群体}}{{The local community organized a charity event.}}
{{compact}}{{/kəmˈpækt}}{{adj./v. 紧凑的；压缩；协议}}{{The apartment is compact but functional.}}
{{companion}}{{/kəmˈpæniən}}{{n. 同伴；伙伴}}{{The dog has been her faithful companion for years.}}
{{comparable}}{{/ˈkɒmpərəbl}}{{adj. 可比较的；类似的}}{{The two products are comparable in quality.}}
{{comparison}}{{/kəmˈpærɪsn}}{{n. 比较；对照}}{{In comparison with last year, sales have increased.}}
{{compatible}}{{/kəmˈpætəbl}}{{adj. 兼容的；合得来的}}{{The new software is compatible with most computers.}}
{{compel}}{{/kəmˈpel}}{{v. 迫使；强迫}}{{The evidence compelled him to change his mind.}}
{{compensate}}{{/ˈkɒmpenseɪt}}{{v. 补偿；赔偿}}{{The company compensated the workers for their overtime.}}
{{compete}}{{/kəmˈpiːt}}{{v. 竞争；比赛}}{{Several companies are competing for the contract.}}
{{competent}}{{/ˈkɒmpɪtənt}}{{adj. 有能力的；胜任的}}{{She is a competent manager with years of experience.}}
{{compile}}{{/kəmˈpaɪl}}{{v. 编辑；汇编；收集}}{{The researcher compiled data from various sources.}}
{{complain}}{{/kəmˈpleɪn}}{{v. 抱怨；投诉}}{{Customers complained about the poor service.}}
{{complement}}{{/ˈkɒmplɪmənt}}{{v./n. 补充；补足；补语}}{{The two colors complement each other perfectly.}}
{{complex}}{{/ˈkɒmpleks}}{{adj./n. 复杂的；综合体}}{{The issue is more complex than it appears.}}
