{{comply}}{{/kəmˈplaɪ}}{{v. 遵守；服从}}{{All employees must comply with the company policy.}}
{{component}}{{/kəmˈpəʊnənt}}{{n. 成分；部件}}{{Each component of the machine must be checked regularly.}}
{{compose}}{{/kəmˈpəʊz}}{{v. 组成；创作；使镇定}}{{The team is composed of experts from various fields.}}
