{{comprise}}{{/kəmˈpraɪz}}{{v. 包含；由…组成；构成}}{{The committee comprises ten members.}}
{{compromise}}{{/ˈkɒmprəmaɪz}}{{n./v. 妥协；折中}}{{Both sides reached a compromise after long negotiations.}}
