{{conservative}}{{/kənˈsɜːvətɪv}}{{adj./n. 保守的；保守派}}{{He holds conservative views on social issues.}}
{{considerable}}{{/kənˈsɪdərəbl}}{{adj. 相当大的；重要的}}{{The project requires a considerable amount of funding.}}
{{consist}}{{/kənˈsɪst}}{{v. 由…组成；在于}}{{The committee consists of ten members.}}
{{consistent}}{{/kənˈsɪstənt}}{{adj. 一致的；持续的}}{{Her performance has been consistent throughout the season.}}
{{consolidate}}{{/kənˈsɒlɪdeɪt}}{{v. 巩固；加强；合并}}{{The company consolidated its market position.}}
{{constant}}{{/ˈkɒnstənt}}{{adj./n. 不变的；常数}}{{The machine operates at a constant speed.}}
{{constitute}}{{/ˈkɒnstɪtjuːt}}{{v. 构成；组成}}{{Women constitute more than half of the population.}}
{{constrain}}{{/kənˈstreɪn}}{{v. 约束；限制；强迫}}{{Budget constraints limited the scope of the project.}}
{{construct}}{{/kənˈstrʌkt}}{{v. 建造；构造}}{{They plan to construct a new hospital in the area.}}
{{consult}}{{/kənˈsʌlt}}{{v. 咨询；查阅}}{{You should consult a doctor about your symptoms.}}
{{consume}}{{/kənˈsjuːm}}{{v. 消耗；消费；吃喝}}{{The car consumes a lot of fuel.}}
{{contact}}{{/ˈkɒntækt}}{{n./v. 接触；联系}}{{Please contact me if you have any questions.}}
{{contain}}{{/kənˈteɪn}}{{v. 包含；控制}}{{The box contains all the necessary documents.}}
{{contaminate}}{{/kənˈtæmɪneɪt}}{{v. 污染；弄脏}}{{The river was contaminated by industrial waste.}}
{{contemplate}}{{/ˈkɒntəmpleɪt}}{{v. 沉思；考虑；注视}}{{She contemplated the meaning of the poem.}}
{{contemporary}}{{/kənˈtemprəri}}{{adj./n. 当代的；同时代的人}}{{The museum has a fine collection of contemporary art.}}
{{contend}}{{/kənˈtend}}{{v. 竞争；主张；争论}}{{Several candidates contended for the position.}}
{{content}}{{/ˈkɒntent}}{{n./adj. 内容；满足的}}{{She was content with her simple life.}}
{{contest}}{{/ˈkɒntest}}{{n./v. 竞赛；争辩}}{{She won first prize in the speech contest.}}
